Modifications in this distribution:

  - Memes are delivered as uploaded file attachments rather than as a
    markdown image referencing a plugin-served URL, so that they render on
    the Mattermost mobile clients.
  - The HTTP handler that rendered templates on demand has been removed. It
    performed no authentication.
  - Asset loading uses //go:embed in place of a generated go-bindata blob.
  - The plugin targets github.com/mattermost/mattermost/server/public in
    place of github.com/mattermost/mattermost-server/v5.
  - Command errors are reported as ephemeral messages rather than AppErrors.
